SUMMARY:Weaving Clasped Weft on Rigid Heddle w/Peggy McIntosh\, Day 2
DESCRIPTION:Using a rigid heddle loom\, students will weave the front and back of a 12-inch designer pillow cover. \nStudents will need a rigid heddle loom at least 12 inches wide with a 7.5-dent or 8-dent heddle to fit the loom. \nLooms may be rented from the guild or the instructor on a first-come\, first-served basis but supplies are limited.  Contact the Guild Librarian\, or the instructor at plmcintosh@gmail.com\, to rent a loom. \nREGISTRATION CLOSED \n\n           Download QR
URL:https://bloomspinweave.org/event/weaving-clasped-weft-on-rigid-heddle-w-peggy-mcintosh-day-2
LOCATION:Fiber Arts Center\, College Mall\, Bloomington\, 3038 East Third Street\, Bloomington\, IN\, 47401\, United States
CATEGORIES:Bloomington Spinners and Weavers Fiber Arts Guild Calendar
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://bloomspinweave.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Weaving-Clasped-Weft-Image-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
