UID:6594-1792929600-1792944000@bloomspinweave.org
SUMMARY:Beginning Granny Square Chickens with Lindsey Alumbaugh\, Day 3
DESCRIPTION:Learn how to make a cute chicken out of only two simple crochet granny squares and a few extra stitches.  This is a beginner level class\, but anyone of any skill level is welcome.  Come knowing nothing about crochet and have a chicken by the end! \nThe workshop will take place over three Saturdays; October 11\, 18\, & 25\, 2026.  12-4 PM each day. \nSession 3: Weave in ends\, join squares\, finish your chicken! \nREGISTRATION CLOSED \n\n           Download QR
URL:https://bloomspinweave.org/event/beginning-granny-square-chickens-with-lindsey-alumbaugh-day-3
CATEGORIES:Bloomington Spinners and Weavers Fiber Arts Guild Calendar
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://bloomspinweave.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/26-Lindsey-Learn-to-make-a-Granny-Square-Chicken.png
END:VEVENT
