SUMMARY:Knitted Holiday Ornament w/April Jennings
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the season by creating a charming handmade knitted holiday ornament perfect for decorating your tree\, gifting to loved ones\, or adding a personal touch to your holiday décor.  In this class\, participants will learn basic shaping\, decorative techniques\, and finishing skills while knitting a festive ornament from start to finish. Students can customize their ornament with colors\, embellishments\, and unique details to make it truly their own.  This class is suitable for adventurous beginners and experienced knitters looking for a fun and festive holiday project. Participants will leave with a completed ornament and the confidence to create additional ornaments for years to come. \nFor more information and to register\, click here. \n\n           Download QR
URL:https://bloomspinweave.org/event/knitted-holiday-ornament-w-april-jennings
CATEGORIES:Bloomington Spinners and Weavers Fiber Arts Guild Calendar
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://bloomspinweave.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Knitted-ornament-April-Jennings-Image-scaled-e1789404315555.jpg
END:VEVENT
